  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Maralal START Shifting the power project 2016</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to strengthen the role of caritas Maralal in humanitarian systems so that they can become more active leaders and decision makers in the humanitarian endeavour.   Caritas Maralal was appointed a lead agency for Samburu County in Kenya to lead the process to develop a county contingency plan with specific focus on  peace and conflict transformation pillar.  This is a national programme called Ending Drought Emergencies.  Besides facilitating peace and security sensitisation sessions, caritas maralal will develop a documentary, a case study on agents of change.  The documentary will be used for learning purpose and also a visibility for Caritas Maralal.</narrative>
  </description>
